            "\\subsubsection{Embedding Layer} Assume that a clinical document $D$ consists of $n$ word tokens $w_1, w_2, ...,  w_i, ..., w_n$. We represent each $i^{th}$ token $w_i$ in $D$ by a pre-trained word embedding $\\boldsymbol{e}_{w_i}$ having the same embedding size of $d_e$. \n",
