            "\\section{Conclusions}\n",
            "In this paper, we have presented a label attention model for ICD coding from clinical text. We also extend our model with a hierarchical joint learning architecture to handle the infrequent ICD codes. Experimental results on three standard benchmark MIMIC datasets show that our label attention model obtains new state-of-the-art performance with substantial improvements across various evaluation metrics over competitive baselines. The hierarchical joint learning architecture also helps significantly improve the performances for infrequent codes, resulting in higher macro-averaged metrics.\n",
